; The one variable: `layout_direction = 3` (RTL) on the lower Button, which swaps the icon and text
; alignment sides (button.cpp:262-276). Both pin alignment 0, since centre is swap-invariant, and the
; icon is asymmetric on X. unit-control-layout-direction-rtl draws no Button, and every other
; Button scene is LTR.

